OL,3,AKenya and DR Congo agree to restore
OL,4,Aties after tensions over conflict
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenya's President William Ruto and his
OL,7,FCongolese counterpart Felix Tshisekedi
OL,8,Fhave agreed to restore full diplomatic
OL,9,Fties between the two countries
OL,10,Ffollowing tensions over the conflict in
OL,11,Feastern Democratic Republic of Congo.
OL,13,FRelations between the two countries
OL,14,Fhave soured since 2023 when DR Congo
OL,15,Faccused Kenya of hosting leaders
OL,16,Flaunching a rebel alliance, including
OL,17,Fthe M23.
OL,19,FThis led DR Congo to recall its envoy
OL,20,Fto Nairobi. Relations deteriorated
OL,21,Ffurther when Kinshasa refusing to
OL,22,Faccredit Kenya's nominated ambassador.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
