OL,3,AKenya and DR Congo agree to restore
OL,4,Aties after tensions over conflict
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, the two leaders affirmed
OL,7,Ftheir commitment to "sovereignty,
OL,8,Fterritorial integrity, non-interference
OL,9,Fin the internal affairs of states".
